      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你在说什么啊？这不是很成功吗！？\n照这状况继续进行实验的话，或许──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7677d7bf524d98c1cf6e16cc2c8c791eb1d88a69e75f92e67ab2792d3a05739",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
