      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇……太棒了，我好感动！\n我该怎么做才能更进一步地\n探讨“朋友”的存在呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "15ecba317f06f402df485f5a1202b198b867182daa2259f48948c4ecb112634b",
