      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们刚才听见的，真的是“朋友”的声音吗？\n爱丽速子无视我的恐惧，\n表现出兴奋不已的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2431779519e9020d9d9c25bd6568cc7bf49fc9f8513e6f8a459e95de678a4ab6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
